<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all four secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all four secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all four credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.566  bln pesos 15 days  25.11  24.73   24.93    11   7</p>
<p>1.567  bln pesos 11 days  24.77  24.51   24.58     9   5</p>
<p>1.567  bln pesos  9 days  24.43  24.25   24.37     3   3</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos  1 day   24.10  24.00   24.01     4   3</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
